Package: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting-atomic
Version: 1.0-2
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting
Recommends: xlibre
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Atomic mode setting for the modesetting driver of XLibre
 X11 OutputClass section that enables atomic mode setting in the
 modesetting driver (default: off). Atomic mode setting needs XLibre or
 a patched Xorg.
